   "text": "each kernel = a plan +\nMetal code + up to 6\nlaunch sizes.\n\nNever sees the judge's\ncode or its secret tests.",
   "originalText": "each kernel = a plan +\nMetal code + up to 6\nlaunch sizes.\n\nNever sees the judge's\ncode or its secret tests.",
