   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each kernel runs alone, with a\ntime limit (bad ones freeze the GPU).\n\nb. inputs: odd lengths (1, 7, 33...),\n   huge values, masked rows, 3 number\n   formats, new random shapes every\n   round, + every input that ever broke\n   a kernel. Plus zero-tolerance checks:\n   unwritten output, writing past the\n   end, 5 runs must match exactly.",
   "originalText": "Each kernel runs alone, with a\ntime limit (bad ones freeze the GPU).\n\nb. inputs: odd lengths (1, 7, 33...),\n   huge values, masked rows, 3 number\n   formats, new random shapes every\n   round, + every input that ever broke\n   a kernel. Plus zero-tolerance checks:\n   unwritten output, writing past the\n   end, 5 runs must match exactly.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
